sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant And as Android Scheduler
    participant Hub as SensingEventHub
    participant Mic as MicCollector
    participant Repo as LocalRepository
    participant DB as Room (SQLCipher v5)
    participant Out as Outbox+SyncWorker
    participant API as FastAPI /v1/*
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox (audit→gaps→forge→validate→induct)
    participant UI as Android UI

    Note over And,API: 场景1 感知窗口 ACK（snapshot→extract→transactional persist→clear consumed）
    And->>Hub: snapshotAll() → HubSnapshot
    And->>Mic: snapshot() → micSnapshot
    And->>And: extractFromHub(snapshot) → DerivedFeatureInput[]
    And->>Repo: saveDerivedFeatures(inputs)
    Repo->>DB: withTransaction { insertFeatureVectors + insertOutboxEvents }
    DB-->>Repo: success
    Repo-->>And: true（成功才更新 lastSuccessfulCollection）
    And->>Hub: clearConsumed(hubSnapshot)
    And->>Mic: clearConsumed(micSnapshot)
    And->>Out: SyncWorker.enqueue()
    alt persist 失败
        Repo-->>And: false
        And->>And: 窗口保留，bounded retry（≤3），记录 consecutivePersistenceFailures
    end

    Note over And,API: 场景2 sources_present 缺口识别（mic_opt 可选 / health 不强制）
    API->>API: POST /v1/features/ingest（幂等 + consent 412 + mic voice_features 412）
    API->>API: build_daily_narrative（events 含 sources_present）
    API-->>And: 200 {id, idempotent_replay, escalation_id:null}
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: audit_day → find_gaps（union sources_present；legacy fallback source）
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: forge_tools（无 mood_check 模板）→ validate → induct_skills（白名单 action_type）

    Note over And,API: 场景3 ActiveSkillSession 恢复与完成（暂停不计时）
    And->>Repo: loadActiveSession()（process death 后）
    Repo-->>And: ActiveSkillSession(status=running|paused)
    And->>And: 恢复为 PAUSED（不自动计时），提示「继续/结束」
    And->>And: 用户完成 → SkillRunSession.complete() → activeDurationMs/1000
    And->>Repo: saveSkillCompletion(eventId, skillId, status, duration)
    Repo->>DB: withTransaction { deleteSession + insertOutbox(skill_completion) }
    And->>Out: SyncWorker.enqueue()
    Out->>API: POST /v1/skills/completions（tenant+event_id 幂等）

    Note over And,API: 场景4 Onboarding verify-code（不暴露内部字段）
    UI->>And: 单「激活码」输入
    And->>API: POST /v1/onboarding/verify-code {code}
    API->>API: 查 User.external_ref==code；active → create_access_token(role=user)
    API-->>And: 200 {user_id, access_token, consent_versions, l0_decision, restricted}
    And->>And: 七态状态机推进（AppPreferences.onboardingState）
    And->>API: POST /v1/onboarding/consents（复用）
    And->>API: POST /v1/onboarding/l0（复用）
    And->>API: POST /v1/onboarding/emergency-contact（复用，可选）

    Note over And,API: 场景5 Skill 契约消费（action_type 白名单分发，fail closed）
    UI->>And: GET /v1/skills（signed + whitelist 下发）
    And->>And: ActionRenderer by action_type（guided_steps/breathing/checklist/journaling/reflection_prompt）
    alt actionType 不在白名单
        And->>And: BlockedRenderer（不渲染开始，不产生 completion）
    end
